XXX mkenums_simple() computes the generated #include relative to meson's cwd
instead of the build dir, which breaks with a non-default WRKOBJDIR.
Copy the header into the build tree to get a plain relative include.
Should be fixed in meson: mkenums_simple() in mesonbuild/modules/gnome.py.

No udisks2 on OpenBSD (XXX add HAVE_UDISKS2 to meson_options.txt)

Index: panels/system/meson.build
--- panels/system/meson.build.orig
+++ panels/system/meson.build
@@ -76,8 +76,10 @@ sources = files(
